"score":0.952},{"text":"is","offset":80,"start":135.502,"end":135.582,"score":0.999},{"text":"similar.","offset":83,"start":135.662,"end":136.042,"score":0.999}]],"cues":[{"id":"b4-007-001","sourceId":"b4-007-001","sourceIndex":0,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"In what way does echo-location in bats play an utilitarian role?","start":11.34,"end":17.14,"score":0.955,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-002-p01","sourceId":"b4-007-002","sourceIndex":1,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Not all sounds made by animals serve as language,","start":19.85,"end":23.42,"score":0.996,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-002-p02","sourceId":"b4-007-002","sourceIndex":1,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[9,36],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and we have only to turn to that extraordinary discovery of echo-location in bats to see a case in which the voice plays a strictly utilitarian role.","start":24.22,"end":35.08,"score":0.961,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-003","sourceId":"b4-007-003","sourceIndex":2,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"To get a full appreciation of what this means we must turn first to some recent human inventions.","start":36.34,"end":43.18,"score":0.963,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-004","sourceId":"b4-007-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Everyone knows that if he shouts in the vicinity of a wall or a mountainside, an echo will come back.","start":44.56,"end":51.6,"score":0.973,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-005","sourceId":"b4-007-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The further off this solid obstruction, the longer time will elapse for the return of the echo.","start":52.403,"end":57.97,"score":0.945,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-006-p01","sourceId":"b4-007-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":3,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"A sound made by tapping on the hull of a ship will be reflected from the sea bottom,","start":59.2,"end":64.75,"score":0.917,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-006-p02","sourceId":"b4-007-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":2,"parts":3,"wordRange":[18,27],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and by measuring the time interval between the taps","start":65.202,"end":68.36,"score":0.975,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-006-p03","sourceId":"b4-007-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":3,"parts":3,"wordRange":[27,44],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and the receipt of the echoes the depth of the sea at that point can be calculated.","start":68.68,"end":73.96,"score":0.957,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-007","sourceId":"b4-007-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"So was born the echo-sounding apparatus, now in general use in ships.","start":75.14,"end":80.71,"score":0.908,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-008","sourceId":"b4-007-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Every solid object will reflect a sound, varying according to the size and nature of the object.","start":81.84,"end":88.86,"score":0.991,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-009","sourceId":"b4-007-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"A shoal of fish will do this.","start":90.12,"end":91.8,"score":0.966,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-010","sourceId":"b4-007-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"So it is a comparatively simple step from locating the sea bottom to locating a shoal of fish.","start":92.98,"end":99.56,"score":0.969,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-011-p01","sourceId":"b4-007-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"With experience, and with improved apparatus, it is now possible not only to locate a shoal but to tell if it is herring,","start":100.91,"end":110.0,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-011-p02","sourceId":"b4-007-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[23,34],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"cod, or other well-known fish, by the pattern of its echo.","start":110.46,"end":114.86,"score":0.927,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-012-p01","sourceId":"b4-007-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It has been found that certain bats emit squeaks and by receiving the echoes,","start":116.32,"end":122.22,"score":0.958,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-012-p02","sourceId":"b4-007-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[14,30],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"they can locate and steer clear of obstacles -- or locate flying insects on which they feed.","start":122.44,"end":129.04,"score":0.934,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-007-013","sourceId":"b4-007-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"This echo-location in bats is often compared with radar, the principle of which is similar.","start":130.03,"end":136.12,"score":0.937,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
